    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present 14 Riverwood Place to the market. This exceptional, larger-style family home is ideally nestled in a quiet enclave of only seventeen houses. Featuring an impressive attic conversion and an extensive south-facing rear garden, this property offers an attractive opportunity for discerning purchasers.\n\nThe interior consists of light-filled living spaces throughout. Accommodation includes an entrance hall with a guest toilet, living room, dining room and kitchen / breakfast room with a complementing utility room. On the first floor, there are three bedrooms, including a master en-suite and a family bathroom. Additionally, the attic has been impressively converted and includes its own toilet. The layout and quality finish make this a perfect turn-key solution for families.\n\nThe exterior features well-appointed gardens, including a secluded 15m / 50ft south-facing rear garden with gated side access. The front driveway provides off-street parking, with additional parking available around this quiet enclave.\n\nRiverwood is excellently located near Castleknock and Blanchardstown villages, the Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and the Phoenix Park. The area is well-serviced by buses and is a 10-minute walk from Coolmine Train Station. The M3, M50, Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport are all easily accessible. The property falls within the catchment area for Castleknock Community College and other reputable schools.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nLiving Room - \n\n\nDining Room - \n\n\nKitchen Breakfast Room - \n\n\nUtility Room - \n\n\nDownstairs Toilet - \n\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - \n\n\nEnsuite - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - \n\n\nBathroom - \n\n\nAttic - \n\n\nAttic Toilet - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Chain Free Sale</li><li> Built by Castlethorn Construction in 1999</li><li> Three-bed semi-detached home c. 1,300sq m/ 1,400sq ft to include the attic conversion</li><li> Superbly converted attic providing c. 22sq m/ 237sq ft of additional space</li><li> Four bathrooms to incl. family bathroom, en-suite, guest toilet and attic toilet</li><li> High standard of finish throughout</li><li> Fitted wardrobes & storage solutions</li><li> Contemporary sanitary ware in all bathrooms</li><li> Double glazed windows and doors</li><li> Aesthetically pleasing external finish with a mixture of brick and render</li><li> Landscaped south facing rear garden of approx. 15m/ 50ft in length</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> Easy access to the N3/ M3/ N4/ M4/ M50 and a 10 minute walk to Coolmine Train Station</ul>"
      },
